the Settings tab's tooltips and the Memory cards tab's messages was rewritten to the writing standard: short sentences,
one fact each, lists where three or more things are named, and the purpose first. The wiki chapter says check and
uncheck in place of tick and untick, and the README links to the wiki in place of the manual. A wrong fact was
corrected: the wiki chapter said Xenia needs FUSE because it comes as an AppImage, but the AppImage also runs without
fusermount and then unpacks itself to a temporary folder on every start. No label was renamed. Nothing the app does has
changed. tests/test_main_window.py asserts the new wording of the Xenia line's tooltip, the game folder's info text, the
info text about Steam and the message about a missing run wrapper.

